# Windows support: check out every text file with LF line endings on every
# machine, so the code and test fixtures are byte-identical on macOS, Linux
# and Windows (git for Windows otherwise converts to CRLF on checkout).
# Duo itself still reads users' own CRLF files correctly (core/vault/eol.ts).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (explicit, so text=auto never guesses wrong).
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
